# Agent Context Exclusion File (.agentignore)
# Prevents autonomous agents, LLM indexing engines, and retrieval tools
# from flooding context with giant catalogs, archived files, and binary fixtures.

# Giant catalogs & taxonomy (human-facing only, forbidden in SKILL.md)
docs/INDEX.json
references/taxonomy/**

# Large regression test scripts and golden baselines
scripts/verify/test-gate-regressions.sh
scripts/verify/golden-gate-output.txt
scripts/verify/fixtures/**

# Historical and archived material
archive/**

# Python & Build artifacts
**/__pycache__/**
*.pyc
.dist/**
node_modules/**

# Git metadata
.git/**
